MainWindow::~MainWindow(){if(desktop_){desktop_->kill();desktop_->waitForFinished(1000);}if(host_){host_->kill();host_->waitForFinished(1000);}if(transfer_){transfer_->kill();transfer_->waitForFinished(1000);}}
void MainWindow::identity(){if(!QFileInfo::exists(state()+"/public-identity.json")){identity_->setText(QStringLiteral("尚未初始化设备"));return;}command({"identity","--state",state()},[this](bool ok,QByteArray b){if(!ok)return;auto j=QJsonDocument::fromJson(b).object();identity_->setText(QStringLiteral("本机 ID：%1    名称：%2\n公钥指纹：%3").arg(j["id"].toString(),j["name"].toString(),j["fingerprint"].toString()));refreshPeers();});}
void MainWindow::onboarding(){
 QDialog d(this);d.setWindowTitle(QStringLiteral("设备初始化 / 注册"));auto* f=new QFormLayout(&d);auto* server=new QLineEdit("https://");auto* name=new QLineEdit(QSysInfo::machineHostName());auto* ca=new QLineEdit;auto* stun=new QLineEdit;auto* token=new QLineEdit;f->addRow(QStringLiteral("服务器 HTTPS 地址"),server);f->addRow(QStringLiteral("设备名称"),name);f->addRow(QStringLiteral("STUN / UDP 中继地址"),stun);auto chooser=[&](QLineEdit* field,const QString& title){auto* row=new QWidget;auto* r=new QHBoxLayout(row);r->setContentsMargins(0,0,0,0);r->addWidget(field);button(QStringLiteral("选择文件"),r,[&,field,title]{auto s=QFileDialog::getOpenFileName(&d,title);if(!s.isEmpty())field->setText(s);});f->addRow(title,row);};chooser(ca,QStringLiteral("服务器公开 CA 证书"));chooser(token,QStringLiteral("注册令牌文件"));auto* note=new QLabel(QStringLiteral("已有身份不会被覆盖。注册令牌不写入界面日志；注册后请妥善保管或删除临时令牌副本。"));note->setWordWrap(true);f->addRow(note);auto* buttons=new QDialogButtonBox(QDialogButtonBox::Ok|QDialogButtonBox::Cancel);f->addRow(buttons);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::accepted,&d,&QDialog::accept);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::rejected,&d,&QDialog::reject);if(d.exec()!=QDialog::Accepted)return;
 const auto dir=state(),t=token->text();if(t.isEmpty()){QMessageBox::warning(this,"RemoteDesk",QStringLiteral("请选择注册令牌文件。"));return;}auto reg=[this,dir,t](bool ok,QByteArray){if(ok)command({"register","--state",dir,"--token-file",t},[this](bool ok,QByteArray){if(ok){appendLog(QStringLiteral("注册完成。"));identity();}});};if(QFileInfo::exists(dir+"/identity.key")){reg(true,{});return;}command({"init","--state",dir,"--server",server->text().trimmed(),"--name",name->text(),"--ca",ca->text(),"--stun",stun->text().trimmed()},reg);
}
void MainWindow::refreshPeers(){if(refreshing_||!QFileInfo::exists(state()+"/identity.key"))return;refreshing_=true;command({"peers","--state",state()},[this](bool ok,QByteArray b){refreshing_=false;if(!ok)return;const auto peers=QJsonDocument::fromJson(b).array();devices_->setRowCount(peers.size());int row=0;for(const auto& v:peers){const auto j=v.toObject(),p=j["permissions"].toObject();QStringList grants;for(const auto& k:{"desktop","control","ssh","files","clipboard","audio"})if(p[k].toBool())grants<<k;devices_->setItem(row,0,new QTableWidgetItem(j["id"].toString()));devices_->setItem(row,1,new QTableWidgetItem(j["name"].toString()));devices_->setItem(row,2,new QTableWidgetItem(j["online"].toBool()?QStringLiteral("在线"):QStringLiteral("离线 / 查询失败")));devices_->setItem(row,3,new QTableWidgetItem(grants.join(", ")));++row;}});}
void MainWindow::trustPeer(){auto path=QFileDialog::getOpenFileName(this,QStringLiteral("选择对方公开身份"),{},"JSON (*.json)");if(path.isEmpty())return;QFile f(path);if(!f.open(QIODevice::ReadOnly)||f.size()>16384)return;const auto j=QJsonDocument::fromJson(f.readAll()).object();if(QMessageBox::question(this,QStringLiteral("核对公钥指纹"),QStringLiteral("请通过可信渠道与对方核对完整指纹：\n\n设备：%1\n指纹：%2\n\n核对无误并授权此设备 SSH 与连接探测？桌面权限需要另外设置。").arg(j["id"].toString(),j["fingerprint"].toString()),QMessageBox::Yes|QMessageBox::No,QMessageBox::No)!=QMessageBox::Yes)return;command({"trust","--state",state(),"--peer-file",path},[this,j](bool ok,QByteArray){if(ok){peer_->setText(j["id"].toString());refreshPeers();}});}
void MainWindow::grantPeer(){if(!QRegularExpression("^[0-9]{12}$").match(target()).hasMatch())return;QDialog d(this);d.setWindowTitle(QStringLiteral("授权设备 %1").arg(target()));auto* f=new QVBoxLayout(&d);auto* note=new QLabel(QStringLiteral("这些权限允许对方访问本机。默认不勾选；保存会替换这些能力授权。撤销后现有媒体会话也会终止。"));note->setWordWrap(true);f->addWidget(note);QStringList names{"desktop","control","clipboard","audio","files"};QList<QCheckBox*> checks;for(const auto& n:names){auto* c=new QCheckBox(n);checks<<c;f->addWidget(c);}auto* buttons=new QDialogButtonBox(QDialogButtonBox::Ok|QDialogButtonBox::Cancel);f->addWidget(buttons);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::accepted,&d,&QDialog::accept);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::rejected,&d,&QDialog::reject);if(d.exec()!=QDialog::Accepted)return;QStringList args{"grant","--state",state(),"--peer",target()};for(int i=0;i<names.size();++i)args<<"--"+names[i]+"="+boolArg(checks[i]->isChecked());command(args,[this](bool,QByteArray){refreshPeers();});}
void MainWindow::configureHost(){QDialog d(this);d.setWindowTitle(QStringLiteral("本机托管设置"));auto* f=new QVBoxLayout(&d);auto* desktop=new QCheckBox(QStringLiteral("允许在当前登录用户桌面接受已授权的远控连接"));auto* share=new QLineEdit;share->setPlaceholderText(QStringLiteral("文件共享目录；留空关闭。不要选系统目录或整个磁盘。"));f->addWidget(desktop);f->addWidget(share);auto* row=new QHBoxLayout;f->addLayout(row);button(QStringLiteral("选择共享目录"),row,[&]{auto s=QFileDialog::getExistingDirectory(&d,QStringLiteral("选择私人共享目录"));if(!s.isEmpty())share->setText(s);});auto* note=new QLabel(QStringLiteral("共享文件会以当前用户权限读写。请使用专用私人目录。LocalSystem 服务不会读取这个目录，也不会直接执行用户桌面程序。"));note->setWordWrap(true);f->addWidget(note);auto* buttons=new QDialogButtonBox(QDialogButtonBox::Ok|QDialogButtonBox::Cancel);f->addWidget(buttons);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::accepted,&d,&QDialog::accept);connect(buttons,&QDialogButtonBox::rejected,&d,&QDialog::reject);if(d.exec()!=QDialog::Accepted)return;command({"configure-host","--state",state(),"--desktop="+boolArg(desktop->isChecked()),"--engine",QCoreApplication::applicationDirPath()+"/remote-media.exe","--receive-dir",share->text()},[this](bool ok,QByteArray){if(ok)appendLog(QStringLiteral("本机配置已保存。停止并重新启动主机后生效；对方公钥权限仍须单独授权。"));});}
void MainWindow::toggleHost(){if(host_&&host_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning){terminateTree(host_);return;}host_=new QProcess(this);connect(host_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardError,this,[this]{appendLog(QString::fromUtf8(host_->readAllStandardError()));});connect(host_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardOutput,this,[this]{appendLog(QString::fromUtf8(host_->readAllStandardOutput()));});connect(host_,&QProcess::started,this,[this]{hostStatus_->setText(QStringLiteral("本次会话主机进程运行中（在线状态以服务器为准）"));});connect(host_,qOverload<int,QProcess::ExitStatus>(&QProcess::finished),this,[this](int c,QProcess::ExitStatus){hostStatus_->setText(QStringLiteral("主机进程已停止：%1").arg(c));refreshPeers();});host_->start(agent(),{"run","--state",state()});}
void MainWindow::connectDesktop(){
 if(!QRegularExpression("^[0-9]{12}$").match(target()).hasMatch()){QMessageBox::warning(this,"RemoteDesk",QStringLiteral("请输入 12 位设备 ID。"));return;}if(desktop_&&desktop_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning){QMessageBox::information(this,"RemoteDesk",QStringLiteral("请先断开现有桌面，再连接或应用新设置。"));return;}
 auto size=resolution_->currentText().split(QChar(0x00d7));if(size.size()!=2)return;desktopData_.clear();desktop_=new QProcess(this);QStringList args{"desktop","--state",state(),"--peer",target(),"--engine",QCoreApplication::applicationDirPath()+"/remote-media.exe","--parent-window",QString::number(qulonglong(video_->winId())),"--width",size[0],"--height",size[1],"--fps",fps_->currentText(),"--monitor",QString::number(monitor_->value()),"--bitrate",QString::number(bitrate_->value()*1000000),"--control="+boolArg(control_->isChecked()),"--clipboard="+boolArg(clipboard_->isChecked()),"--audio="+boolArg(audio_->isChecked())};if(relay_->isChecked())args<<"--relay-only";
 connect(desktop_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardOutput,this,[this]{parseMedia(desktop_->readAllStandardOutput());});connect(desktop_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardError,this,[this]{appendLog(QString::fromUtf8(desktop_->readAllStandardError()));});connect(desktop_,qOverload<int,QProcess::ExitStatus>(&QProcess::finished),this,[this](int c,QProcess::ExitStatus){videoStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("远程桌面已结束：%1，诊断信息见日志。").arg(c));});desktop_->start(agent(),args);tabs_->setCurrentIndex(1);videoStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("正在鉴权并建立加密连接……"));
}
void MainWindow::stopDesktop(){if(desktop_)terminateTree(desktop_);}
void MainWindow::parseMedia(const QByteArray& data){desktopData_+=data;if(desktopData_.size()>65536){desktopData_.clear();return;}for(;;){int n=desktopData_.indexOf('\n');if(n<0)break;auto line=desktopData_.left(n);desktopData_.remove(0,n+1);auto j=QJsonDocument::fromJson(line).object();if(j["event"]=="media-stats"){videoStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("实际渲染 %1 FPS · RTT %2 ms · 解码提交 %3 μs · 渲染提交 %4 μs · 队列 %5 bytes · 丢弃 %6").arg(j["render_fps"].toDouble(),0,'f',1).arg(j["rtt_ms"].toDouble(),0,'f',1).arg(j["decode_submit_us"].toDouble()).arg(j["render_submit_us"].toDouble()).arg(j["send_queue_bytes"].toDouble()).arg(j["dropped"].toDouble()));}else appendLog(QString::fromUtf8(line));}}
void MainWindow::ssh(){if(!QRegularExpression("^[0-9]{12}$").match(target()).hasMatch())return;bool ok=false;const auto user=QInputDialog::getText(this,QStringLiteral("SSH 用户"),QStringLiteral("远端 Windows / OpenSSH 用户名"),QLineEdit::Normal,{},&ok).trimmed();if(!ok||user.isEmpty()||user.contains('\n')||user.contains('\r'))return;auto* terminal=createTerminal(state(),target(),user,relay_->isChecked(),tabs_);int i=tabs_->addTab(terminal,QStringLiteral("SSH %1").arg(target()));tabs_->setCurrentIndex(i);}
void MainWindow::listFiles(){fileOperation("list",{},remoteDir_->text(),false);}
void MainWindow::upload(bool folder){QString path=folder?QFileDialog::getExistingDirectory(this,QStringLiteral("上传文件夹")):QFileDialog::getOpenFileName(this,QStringLiteral("上传文件"));if(path.isEmpty())return;auto answer=QMessageBox::question(this,QStringLiteral("覆盖确认"),QStringLiteral("允许覆盖远端同名文件吗？选“否”时遇到同名文件会停止；取消则不上传。"),QMessageBox::Yes|QMessageBox::No|QMessageBox::Cancel,QMessageBox::No);if(answer==QMessageBox::Cancel)return;fileOperation(folder?"put-folder":"put",path,linePath(remoteDir_->text(),QFileInfo(path).fileName()),answer==QMessageBox::Yes);}
void MainWindow::download(){const int row=files_->currentRow();if(row<0||files_->item(row,1)->data(Qt::UserRole).toBool())return;const auto name=files_->item(row,0)->text();const auto path=QFileDialog::getSaveFileName(this,QStringLiteral("保存下载文件"),name);if(path.isEmpty())return;const bool overwrite=QFileInfo::exists(path);fileOperation("get",path,linePath(remoteDir_->text(),name),overwrite);}
void MainWindow::cancelFile(){terminateTree(transfer_);}
void MainWindow::fileOperation(const QString& op,const QString& local,const QString& remote,bool overwrite){
 if(!QRegularExpression("^[0-9]{12}$").match(target()).hasMatch())return;if(transfer_&&transfer_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning){QMessageBox::information(this,"RemoteDesk",QStringLiteral("已有文件操作正在执行，请等待完成或取消。"));return;}
 transferData_.clear();transferLines_.clear();transfer_=new QProcess(this);QStringList args{"file","--state",state(),"--peer",target(),"--op",op,"--remote",remote,"--rate","1048576","--overwrite="+boolArg(overwrite)};if(!local.isEmpty())args<<"--local"<<local;if(relay_->isChecked())args<<"--relay-only";
 connect(transfer_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardError,this,[this]{appendLog(QString::fromUtf8(transfer_->readAllStandardError()));});connect(transfer_,&QProcess::readyReadStandardOutput,this,[this,op]{const auto b=transfer_->readAllStandardOutput();if(op=="list"){transferData_+=b;if(transferData_.size()>1024*1024)transfer_->kill();return;}transferLines_+=b;if(transferLines_.size()>65536){transfer_->kill();return;}for(;;){int i=transferLines_.indexOf('\n');if(i<0)break;auto line=transferLines_.left(i);transferLines_.remove(0,i+1);const auto j=QJsonDocument::fromJson(line).object();const auto total=j["total"].toDouble(),bytes=j["bytes"].toDouble();fileProgress_->setValue(total>0?int(bytes*1000/total):0);fileStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("%1 · %2 / %3 bytes · %4 KiB/s").arg(j["path"].toString()).arg(bytes,0,'f',0).arg(total,0,'f',0).arg(j["bytes_per_second"].toDouble()/1024,0,'f',1));}});
 connect(transfer_,qOverload<int,QProcess::ExitStatus>(&QProcess::finished),this,[this,op](int code,QProcess::ExitStatus status){if(code!=0||status!=QProcess::NormalExit){fileStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("操作未完成或已取消。可重试恢复，错误见诊断日志。"));return;}if(op=="list"){const auto j=QJsonDocument::fromJson(transferData_).object();const auto entries=j["entries"].toArray();files_->setRowCount(entries.size());int row=0;for(const auto& e:entries){const auto o=e.toObject();files_->setItem(row,0,new QTableWidgetItem(o["name"].toString()));auto* type=new QTableWidgetItem(o["directory"].toBool()?QStringLiteral("目录"):QStringLiteral("文件"));type->setData(Qt::UserRole,o["directory"].toBool());files_->setItem(row,1,type);files_->setItem(row,2,new QTableWidgetItem(QString::number(o["size"].toDouble(),'f',0)));++row;}fileStats_->setText(j["more"].toBool()?QStringLiteral("仅显示前 500 项；请进入更小目录继续查看。"):QStringLiteral("目录已更新。"));}else{fileProgress_->setValue(1000);fileStats_->setText(QStringLiteral("传输完成，SHA-256 校验通过。"));}});transfer_->start(agent(),args);
}
void MainWindow::closeEvent(QCloseEvent* e){if((host_&&host_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning)||(desktop_&&desktop_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning)||(transfer_&&transfer_->state()!=QProcess::NotRunning)){if(QMessageBox::question(this,"RemoteDesk",QStringLiteral("退出会断开当前桌面、文件及本次启动的主机进程。继续？"),QMessageBox::Yes|QMessageBox::No,QMessageBox::No)!=QMessageBox::Yes){e->ignore();return;}}stopDesktop();terminateTree(host_);cancelFile();e->accept();}
